            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.11.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Ramblr now reserves the pause/resume shortcut only while a recording is active, leaving the shortcut available to other apps whenever Ramblr is idle.
]]></description>
